  "rationale": "D5 of the growth-clock spec for inverse flames, data-informed (not zero-shot), one scenario for a committee: the carried D1 plus a law that a flame in the marginal band of the mixture fraction (0.47 to about 0.55) is held in a limit cycle when the oxygen flow is high (two train flames of two, at 9 mg/s; five flames at 5.4 mg/s or less went out). It replaces the total-flow scenario D2, which the author's recount of the train outcomes weakened. Every number typed by the author; no fit, no search; no validation outcome was read, the validation conditions were.",
